{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010_02_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8a8d82802a3c9aa6d1d2e3a55d2c05f822560214ec420f7fc57e1e69afdd300c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e9aeff1f6f4049de6dfa9b0849bb27f39599ed227e67483d66e55764244bb54",
      "text": "幸福的姿态",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c18c51fd92ddca902547872537d0c246cdaceba427b34afdd7de01d5bf9d4491",
      "text": "因为喜欢母亲做的瑞士卷，\n卷绪开始四处品尝其他蛋糕。\n在吃遍了附近的蛋糕后，\n他被从未闻过的蛋糕香气吸引，\n来到了Cafe Parade。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e9aeff1f6f4049de6dfa9b0849bb27f39599ed227e67483d66e55764244bb54",
      "text": "幸福的姿态",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe92a8cac07f9805703f3bb9d04720e345fd599935abf620b54d7efb7b5a6ada",
      "text": "卷绪，生日快乐。\n妈妈做了蛋糕哦。尝尝看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd5f613c0132ec022e1a02221067907f49ea7e6cda3f8cd1284178d1b7948e11",
      "text": "哇啊，是瑞士卷！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2d9df214fa552511bf2b3685ba9655f303e3927bb0b3b81c0c265d38f0f90e2",
      "text": "虽然形状稍微有点塌掉了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bf0e4ff88461f2a15b0f47b7da5634cc0fb232d3843085c52fd0675177f3085",
      "text": "但是，妈妈施了能让卷绪感到幸福的\n魔法哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7c99b7db5b51bef7e52c0180435b41796fd221ad9d0f943b7742fa5d6ec51cd",
      "text": "真的吗？\n我最喜欢妈妈做的蛋糕了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de341e35f958a24184c1749b15f66695a2c3725563936a97f8a6a16c7372257c",
      "text": "妈妈，谢谢你。我好幸福！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6954bb21321f23305e8ff12bb788c714e4cbec908e5c1aa2e52bedfa2c6fa393",
      "text": "卷绪能这么高兴，妈妈也很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd89cd41af243b916cd415e87e8271ef3eb3315c7d2504d0d95ee26bde046657",
      "text": "（……小时候，妈妈给我做的\n形状有点奇怪的瑞士卷）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0dec348d994d804c7c8d44d991a13ef630ee2e01ce4c696144dd19ca4687740",
      "text": "（由于家里经常搬家，\n生日派对上即使没有朋友）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e792d851c2f90a734bca6870811d52db8cbcd0a1d05f02244a2496f0f64af51",
      "text": "（只要一家人一起吃，就能感到满满的幸福）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:deb902155e21ad9c0b8948192e1793ffcdc41c5cf1ca727882fa1528d83010da",
      "text": "（对我来说，蛋糕就是幸福的象征……\n所以，我想吃更多不同的蛋糕！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74c31c41d989f44f7d0d4dab25dcad7819d36536b2c491a3a28bee4f06117aeb",
      "text": "今天也要去寻找美味的蛋糕啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
